<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 23 0 R/T(After the military fort lost its strategic value, much of the old citadel was dismantled in the 1920s. The hilltop was then adapted for civic infrastructure with the construction of the Fort Canning Service Reservoir. The change marks a new phase in which the hill shifted from defence to public utility.)/E(After the military fort lost its strategic value, much of the old citadel was dismantled in the 1920s. The hilltop was then adapted for civic infrastructure with the construction of the Fort Canning Service Reservoir. The change marks a new phase in which the hill shifted from defence to public utility.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[13]>>
