<</Title(Raffles, Residence & Reform)/Dest[8 0 R/Fit]/Parent 438 0 R/Prev 605 0 R/First 617 0 R/Last 617 0 R/Count -1/Next 589 0 R>>
endobj

607 0 obj
<</Title(Raffles House marks the site of the early Government House.)/Dest[8 0 R/Fit]/Parent 589 0 R/Next 618 0 R>>
endobj

608 0 obj
<</Title(The Flagstaff, Lighthouse and Timeball formed part of a communication system that helped ships and signalled time across the harbour.)/Dest[8 0 R/Fit]/Parent 589 0 R/Prev 618 0 R/First 619 0 R/Last 619 0 R/Count -1>>
endobj

