endobj

613 0 obj
<</Title(The Fort Wall and Fort Gate are surviving features of the citadel.)/Dest[10 0 R/Fit]/Parent 594 0 R/Next 625 0 R>>
endobj

614 0 obj
<</Title(The 9-Pound Cannon recalls the artillery once positioned on the hill.)/Dest[10 0 R/Fit]/Parent 594 0 R/Prev 625 0 R/First 626 0 R/Last 626 0 R/Count -1>>
